SUMMARY:Friday Nights at OMCA with LA GENTE SF
LOCATION:Oakland Museum\, 1000 Oak St\, Oakland\, CA 94607
DESCRIPTION:Live Music by LA GENTE SF\, DJ Set by mare.e.fresh\, and Galler
 y Chats Friday Night at OMCA brings an infectious global sound to the Gard
 en Stage as San Francisco’s LA GENTE SF delivers a high-energy live perf
 ormance blending Cumbia\, Salsa\, and Reggaeton. Led by singer-songwriter 
 Rafa Sarria Bustamante\, the group fuses rhythms and cultural influences f
 rom across Latin America and the Caribbean with a distinct San Francisco f
 lavor\, creating a joyful dance party that brings audiences together.\nhtt
 ps://museumca.org/event/friday-nights-at-omca-with-la-gente-sf/\nFrom Push
 pin Bay Area: https://pushpin.city/bayarea/
URL:https://museumca.org/event/friday-nights-at-omca-with-la-gente-sf/
END:VEVENT
