SUMMARY:Steffani Jemison and Leslie Cuyjet on Maren Hassinger and Senga Nen
 gudi
LOCATION:BAMPFA\, 2155 Center St\, Berkeley\, CA 94704
DESCRIPTION:Artist Steffani Jemison and choreographer Leslie Cuyjet perform
  a collaborative piece that reflects on the dynamic artistic relationship 
 between Maren Hassinger and Senga Nengudi\, the intense intimacy and attun
 ement involved in longstanding artistic collaborations\, and the powerful 
 intergenerational legacy of the artists' collective works.\nhttps://bampfa
 .org/event/steffani-jemison-and-leslie-cuyjet-maren-hassinger-and-senga-ne
 ngudi\nFrom Pushpin Bay Area: https://pushpin.city/bayarea/
